{"type":"text","timestamp":1794322275216,"sessionID":"ses_e3a0f5faeffeaja4roFLLuM44w","part":{"id":"prt_1c5f11b69001TgyY8M1tydifqv","messageID":"msg_1c5f10e21001M2b3H2ynfh6oDU","sessionID":"ses_e3a0f5faeffeaja4roFLLuM44w","type":"text","text":"<think>Let me plan the work. I need to:\n\n1. Backend: Flask app with SQLite under `./data`, auth (register/login with token), reservations CRUD, availability, admin endpoint, capacity enforcement (20 guests per slot).\n2. Frontend: React + TS + Vite + Tailwind CSS.\n\nLet me check the environment: python version, node version, npm availability, and whether we can install packages (tailwind).\n\nLet me set up a todo list and check tooling.</think>\n\n","time":{"start":1794322275177,"end":1794322275211}}}
