{"type":"step_start","timestamp":1794322668179,"sessionID":"ses_e3a0f5faeffeaja4roFLLuM44w","part":{"id":"prt_1c5f71a83001ZXJNR0DJDxWlkw","messageID":"msg_1c5f7086e001d2v06vnn73Tbra","sessionID":"ses_e3a0f5faeffeaja4roFLLuM44w","type":"step-start"}}
{"type":"text","timestamp":1794322668180,"sessionID":"ses_e3a0f5faeffeaja4roFLLuM44w","part":{"id":"prt_1c5f71a86001WHYOyoupfVHrLT","messageID":"msg_1c5f7086e001d2v06vnn73Tbra","sessionID":"ses_e3a0f5faeffeaja4roFLLuM44w","type":"text","text":"<think>Issues:\n\n1. `export { ApiError };` at the end of App.tsx — unnecessary; remove it (and the unused import of ApiError). Actually ApiError is imported but unused → `noUnusedLocals` error. Remove both.\n\n2. `handleSignedIn` sets user with id 0 — a bit hacky. Better: after login/register, fetch /api/auth/me to get the real user. Let me restructure: the AuthPanel calls `login()` which returns the token... but the token is stored inside api.login? No — api.login returns the token but doesn't store it. I need to store it.\n\nLet me restructure the auth flow properly:\n- `api.login` returns { token, username, is_admin }. The caller stores the token via `storeToken(session.token)` then fetches `me`.\n\nLet me change AuthPanel's `onSignedIn` to pass the token, and App stores it and fetches me.\n\nI'll change the AuthPanel prop signature: `onSignedIn: (token: string) => void`, and App does:\n\n```tsx\nfunction handleSignedIn(token: string) {\n  storeToken(token);\n  void fetchMe().then(setUser).catch(() => { storeToken(null); });\n}\n```\n\nThat's cleaner. Let me update both files.\n\n3. In `handleSignedIn`, if the user is an admin, `user.is_admin` comes from /api/auth/me → correct.\n\nLet me apply these changes.</think>\n\n","time":{"start":1794322668166,"end":1794322668177}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794322668217,"sessionID":"ses_e3a0f5faeffeaja4roFLLuM44w","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"edit","callID":"call_kcNP9HOOK7hxSfMaGF4IF6u9","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/workspace/frontend/src/App.tsx","newString":"import { useCallback, useEffect, useState } from \"react\";\nimport {\n  fetchAllAdminReservations,\n  fetchAvailability,\n  fetchMe,\n  fetchReservations,\n  getStoredToken,\n  logout as apiLogout,\n  storeToken,\n} from \"./api\";","oldString":"import { useCallback, useEffect, useState } from \"react\";\nimport {\n  ApiError,\n  fetchAllAdminReservations,\n  fetchAvailability,\n  fetchMe,\n  fetchReservations,\n  getStoredToken,\n  logout as apiLogout,\n  storeToken,\n} from \"./api\";"},"output":"Edit applied successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"diff":"Index: /workspace/frontend/src/App.tsx\n===================================================================\n--- /workspace/frontend/src/App.tsx\n+++ /workspace/frontend/src/App.tsx\n@@ -1,7 +1,6 @@\n import { useCallback, useEffect, useState } from \"react\";\n import {\n-  ApiError,\n   fetchAllAdminReservations,\n   fetchAvailability,\n   fetchMe,\n   fetchReservations,\n","filediff":{"file":"/workspace/frontend/src/App.tsx","patch":"Index: /workspace/frontend/src/App.tsx\n===================================================================\n--- /workspace/frontend/src/App.tsx\n+++ /workspace/frontend/src/App.tsx\n@@ -1,7 +1,6 @@\n import { useCallback, useEffect, useState } from \"react\";\n import {\n-  ApiError,\n   fetchAllAdminReservations,\n   fetchAvailability,\n   fetchMe,\n   fetchReservations,\n","additions":0,"deletions":1},"truncated":false},"title":"frontend/src/App.tsx","time":{"start":1794322668174,"end":1794322668186}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[]}},"id":"prt_1c5f71a88001ulipIp4ys8Tp9l","sessionID":"ses_e3a0f5faeffeaja4roFLLuM44w","messageID":"msg_1c5f7086e001d2v06vnn73Tbra"}}
