{"type":"text","timestamp":1794322704134,"sessionID":"ses_e3a0f5faeffeaja4roFLLuM44w","part":{"id":"prt_1c5f7a6ea0016N4F80V54YLddU","messageID":"msg_1c5f79803001SPVt0qyT4iqcy6","sessionID":"ses_e3a0f5faeffeaja4roFLLuM44w","type":"text","text":"<think>Playwright is available via npx (it installed playwright 1.65.0 into the npx cache). But browsers need to be downloaded (`playwright install chromium`) which requires network access to the browser CDN — probably blocked (\"no other network access\" besides package registries). Let me try quickly; if it fails, I'll test the frontend logic differently.\n\nActually, the npx playwright package was installed from npm (registry works). Browser binaries come from a CDN (playwright.azureedge.net / cdn.playwright.dev) — likely blocked. Let me try briefly with a timeout.\n\nMeanwhile, let me start the full app and test the API + static serving.</think>\n\n","time":{"start":1794322704106,"end":1794322704130}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794322707224,"sessionID":"ses_e3a0f5faeffeaja4roFLLuM44w","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"bash","callID":"call_aqpqnQbK2oAThVQcF7nqfn3C","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cd /workspace && (ADMIN_PASSWORD=secret123 DATA_DIR=/workspace/data /workspace/.venv/bin/python -c \"\nimport sys; sys.path.insert(0, 'backend')\nimport app\napp.app.run(port=8000)\n\" > /workspace/.server8000.log 2>&1 &) ; sleep 3; curl -s http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/health; echo; curl -s http://127.0.0.1:8000/ | head -20"},"output":"{\"status\":\"ok\"}\n\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n  <head>\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n    <title>App</title>\n    <script type=\"module\" crossorigin src=\"/assets/index-00VjfxLD.js\"></script>\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" crossorigin href=\"/assets/index-DgJBooom.css\">\n  </head>\n  <body>\n    <div id=\"root\"></div>\n  </body>\n</html>\n","metadata":{"output":"{\"status\":\"ok\"}\n\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n  <head>\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n    <title>App</title>\n    <script type=\"module\" crossorigin src=\"/assets/index-00VjfxLD.js\"></script>\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" crossorigin href=\"/assets/index-DgJBooom.css\">\n  </head>\n  <body>\n    <div id=\"root\"></div>\n  </body>\n</html>\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"cd /workspace && (ADMIN_PASSWORD=secret123 DATA_DIR=/workspace/data /workspace/.venv/bin/python -c \"\nimport sys; sys.path.insert(0, 'backend')\nimport app\napp.app.run(port=8000)\n\" > /workspace/.server8000.log 2>&1 &) ; sleep 3; curl -s http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/health; echo; curl -s http://127.0.0.1:8000/ | head -20","time":{"start":1794322704124,"end":1794322707221}},"id":"prt_1c5f7a6f7001c9eu3D2K65pXfQ","sessionID":"ses_e3a0f5faeffeaja4roFLLuM44w","messageID":"msg_1c5f79803001SPVt0qyT4iqcy6"}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794322710162,"sessionID":"ses_e3a0f5faeffeaja4roFLLuM44w","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"bash","callID":"call_yC8FDewrhsvkUnQPOOOnjd9T","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cd /workspace/frontend && timeout 240 npx playwright install chromium 2>&1 | tail -5"},"output":"Error: Failed to download Chrome for Testing 158.0.8127.18 (playwright chromium v1254), caused by\nError: Download failure, code=1\n    at ChildProcess.<anonymous> (/tmp/llmlab-deps/npm/_npx/e41f203b7505f1fb/node_modules/playwright-core/lib/coreBundle.js:34127:32)\n    at ChildProcess.emit (node:events:514:28)\n    at ChildProcess._handle.onexit (node:internal/child_process:324:12)\n","metadata":{"output":"Error: Failed to download Chrome for Testing 158.0.8127.18 (playwright chromium v1254), caused by\nError: Download failure, code=1\n    at ChildProcess.<anonymous> (/tmp/llmlab-deps/npm/_npx/e41f203b7505f1fb/node_modules/playwright-core/lib/coreBundle.js:34127:32)\n    at ChildProcess.emit (node:events:514:28)\n    at ChildProcess._handle.onexit (node:internal/child_process:324:12)\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"cd /workspace/frontend && timeout 240 npx playwright install chromium 2>&1 | tail -5","time":{"start":1794322704113,"end":1794322710141}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[]}},"id":"prt_1c5f7a6ec001322dCKmE0LiAPb","sessionID":"ses_e3a0f5faeffeaja4roFLLuM44w","messageID":"msg_1c5f79803001SPVt0qyT4iqcy6"}}
